    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eSlim LED Panel 20W\u003c/strong\u003e incorporates the \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM\u003c/strong\u003e DURIS E 2835 high-brightness diode, with a \u003cstrong\u003e120º\u003c/strong\u003e beam angle, ideal for evenly illuminating all types of commercial establishments. Thanks to its modern and attractive design, you will have different types of decoration.\u003c/p\u003e",
